1
00:01:42,719 --> 00:01:44,599
The trace evidence gathered from Gao Min's place

2
00:01:44,719 --> 00:01:45,879
yielded no matching samples

3
00:01:45,959 --> 00:01:47,359
in the criminal database.

4
00:01:47,840 --> 00:01:49,079
For now, we can be certain

5
00:01:49,239 --> 00:01:51,040
that the suspect has no criminal record.

6
00:01:51,120 --> 00:01:52,120
As for the Jiangyang police,

7
00:01:52,719 --> 00:01:54,400
they haven't found the supplier yet,

8
00:01:54,560 --> 00:01:55,640
nor any trace of Cheng Weimin.

9
00:01:56,319 --> 00:01:58,519
Every employee at Xinghai Trading Company

10
00:01:58,519 --> 00:02:01,239
denied any connection to this drug case.

11
00:02:01,239 --> 00:02:02,319
As for this Qian Feng,

12
00:02:03,319 --> 00:02:05,359
nobody knows anything about him.

13
00:02:06,519 --> 00:02:07,079
By the way,

14
00:02:07,560 --> 00:02:09,439
how did you learn the name Qian Feng?

15
00:02:09,800 --> 00:02:10,639
When Zhuang Yan and I

16
00:02:10,639 --> 00:02:12,240
went to Hongzhuang Garden to investigate,

17
00:02:12,240 --> 00:02:13,240
the old man at the convenience store told us.

18
00:02:14,080 --> 00:02:15,919
Besides, when we interrogated Gao Min earlier

19
00:02:16,080 --> 00:02:17,319
and brought up the name Qian Feng,

20
00:02:17,919 --> 00:02:19,000
judging by her reaction,

21
00:02:19,360 --> 00:02:20,199
we must have the right name.

22
00:02:24,039 --> 00:02:25,719
It could still be a fake name.

23
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:29,599
She was conned from start to finish.

24
00:02:32,039 --> 00:02:34,199
If we can't verify Qian Feng's identity,

25
00:02:35,360 --> 00:02:37,319
our investigation won't be able to move forward.

26
00:02:38,520 --> 00:02:39,080
Here's what we'll do.

27
00:02:39,199 --> 00:02:41,000
Let's assume for now that Qian Feng

28
00:02:41,199 --> 00:02:42,240
isn't a local resident.

29
00:02:42,879 --> 00:02:44,680
You two check with the precinct tomorrow

30
00:02:45,240 --> 00:02:46,759
to see if anyone named Qian Feng

31
00:02:47,240 --> 00:02:48,159
over the past three months

32
00:02:48,319 --> 00:02:49,639
has a record of frequent hotel stays.

33
00:02:52,599 --> 00:02:54,120
Ge Dan, the two of us

34
00:02:54,599 --> 00:02:55,960
will head back to Hongzhuang Garden to look around.

35
00:02:57,159 --> 00:02:57,919
All right. Got it.

36
00:03:10,639 --> 00:03:11,360
Okay, got it.

37
00:03:14,400 --> 00:03:15,360
Guan Qiang called.

38
00:03:15,639 --> 00:03:17,080
They checked numerous hotels.

39
00:03:17,439 --> 00:03:19,319
In recent months, no one named Qian Feng

40
00:03:19,360 --> 00:03:20,439
had frequent check-in records.

41
00:03:21,280 --> 00:03:22,919
Maybe the suspect we're pursuing

42
00:03:23,159 --> 00:03:24,199
isn't even named Qian Feng.

43
00:03:25,719 --> 00:03:27,000
This guy hides even better than Wu Liang.

44
00:03:28,319 --> 00:03:29,680
If Gao Min won't talk,

45
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:31,840
then for any leads on Qian Feng,

46
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:32,919
Jiangyang police will have to

47
00:03:32,919 --> 00:03:34,560
get a breakthrough from the sender, Cheng Weimin.

48
00:03:36,599 --> 00:03:38,719
If Xinghai Trading is running a corporate front

49
00:03:38,960 --> 00:03:40,120
to build a drug distribution network,

50
00:03:40,639 --> 00:03:41,919
then the suspects and the case itself

51
00:03:42,080 --> 00:03:43,479
will be far more complex

52
00:03:43,560 --> 00:03:44,439
than an ordinary drug case.

53
00:03:45,879 --> 00:03:47,199
Looks like Jiangyang police

54
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:48,439
are under no less pressure than we are.

55
00:03:50,680 --> 00:03:52,199
But right now, regarding Qian Feng's whereabouts,

56
00:03:52,199 --> 00:03:53,439
we have no leads at all.

57
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:55,800
If we go back to Hongzhuang Garden Community,

58
00:03:56,199 --> 00:03:57,719
do you think we'll find anything more?

59
00:03:58,319 --> 00:04:00,639
If there are no leads, keep searching.

60
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:01,719
Search until we find him.

61
00:04:02,280 --> 00:04:03,639
Have you ever considered

62
00:04:04,199 --> 00:04:05,759
that something's wrong with the logistics company?

63
00:04:06,319 --> 00:04:09,280
Zhongtian Logistics has state capital backing.

64
00:04:10,240 --> 00:04:11,719
Their management is relatively standardized.

65
00:04:11,759 --> 00:04:14,199
And they're preparing for financing and an IPO.

66
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:17,160
With business going so well,

67
00:04:17,360 --> 00:04:19,399
the top executives wouldn't take such risks.

68
00:04:20,399 --> 00:04:21,399
Unless there's an issue here.

69
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:45,360
Sir,

70
00:04:45,879 --> 00:04:46,519
let me give you a hand.

71
00:04:47,040 --> 00:04:47,439
All right.

72
00:04:47,720 --> 00:04:48,439
Thank you.

73
00:04:50,480 --> 00:04:51,800
Sir, how much do I owe you?

74
00:04:51,800 --> 00:04:52,519
Coming!

75
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:05,639
39.40 yuan.

76
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:07,240
Bag it.

77
00:05:08,959 --> 00:05:09,920
You're back again.

78
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:14,399
Hello.

79
00:05:15,560 --> 00:05:16,720
Just leave it inside my place.

80
00:05:16,800 --> 00:05:17,360
Thanks.

81
00:05:18,120 --> 00:05:18,639
What?

82
00:05:19,800 --> 00:05:21,639
Other couriers bring it right into my home.

83
00:05:21,800 --> 00:05:23,560
Why can't Zhongtian Logistics do that?

84
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:25,839
The seller promised door-to-door delivery.

85
00:05:26,920 --> 00:05:27,920
If you don't bring it to my door,

86
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:29,279
I'll refuse to sign for it.

87
00:05:29,279 --> 00:05:30,279
If the package gets lost,

88
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:31,759
that's on you.

89
00:05:35,839 --> 00:05:37,319
This shipment arrived this morning.

90
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:38,319
It's urgent.

91
00:05:38,439 --> 00:05:40,000
It must reach the client's home this afternoon.

92
00:05:48,079 --> 00:05:48,759
Guan Qiang,

93
00:05:49,720 --> 00:05:50,680
look into something for me.

94
00:05:50,959 --> 00:05:52,399
Under what circumstances does

95
00:05:52,680 --> 00:05:53,879
Zhongtian Logistics deliver to a customer's door?

96
00:05:54,600 --> 00:05:55,399
I'll wait for your update.

97
00:05:58,800 --> 00:06:00,360
Sir, are you saying

98
00:06:00,519 --> 00:06:03,240
every time Qian Feng met Gao Min,

99
00:06:03,240 --> 00:06:04,319
it was Monday through Friday?

100
00:06:04,360 --> 00:06:05,360
On weekdays, right?

101
00:06:06,079 --> 00:06:06,399
Yes.

102
00:06:06,879 --> 00:06:08,399
Because whenever they came to shop,

103
00:06:08,399 --> 00:06:08,959
it was always pretty late.

104
00:06:09,759 --> 00:06:11,079
They were usually the last customers.

105
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:12,600
That's why I remember it so clearly.

106
00:06:13,439 --> 00:06:15,480
What time do you mean by "pretty late"?

107
00:06:15,480 --> 00:06:17,800
Usually after ten o'clock.

108
00:06:18,040 --> 00:06:19,240
Sometimes even later.

109
00:06:19,240 --> 00:06:21,279
Often, they'd show up in pajamas.

110
00:06:23,600 --> 00:06:26,079
Whenever Qian Feng met this woman,

111
00:06:26,079 --> 00:06:27,160
what time was it usually?

112
00:06:27,360 --> 00:06:28,600
Always in the morning.

113
00:06:29,120 --> 00:06:30,959
Because the place next door sells breakfast.

114
00:06:31,160 --> 00:06:31,839
Quite often,

115
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:33,399
early in the morning, that woman

116
00:06:33,399 --> 00:06:35,360
would come buy food with him.

117
00:06:41,079 --> 00:06:41,680
Go ahead.

118
00:06:41,920 --> 00:06:42,720
I've checked.

119
00:06:42,879 --> 00:06:45,079
Zhongtian Logistics usually only handles freight shipping.

120
00:06:45,279 --> 00:06:46,759
They require clients to go to the regional hub

121
00:06:46,759 --> 00:06:47,639
to pick up the goods themselves.

122
00:06:48,279 --> 00:06:49,839
For clients wanting home delivery,

123
00:06:49,839 --> 00:06:51,720
they charge an extra forwarding fee,

124
00:06:51,879 --> 00:06:52,959
but they actually outsource it

125
00:06:52,959 --> 00:06:54,399
to another courier service.

126
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:55,959
Yet all the packages Gao Min received

127
00:06:56,160 --> 00:06:58,519
were delivered straight to her door by Zhongtian itself.

128
00:06:58,639 --> 00:06:59,399
Understood.

129
00:06:59,519 --> 00:07:00,720
Ge Dan and I will investigate tomorrow.

130
00:07:02,959 --> 00:07:03,639
Thank you, sir.

131
00:07:04,199 --> 00:07:04,720
Don't mention it.

132
00:07:05,279 --> 00:07:06,600
If there's anything else you need,

133
00:07:06,839 --> 00:07:08,399
just stop by anytime.

134
00:07:13,879 --> 00:07:14,319
Sir,

135
00:07:15,040 --> 00:07:16,439
when Qian Feng bought things here,

136
00:07:16,600 --> 00:07:18,040
did he always pay with Alipay?

137
00:07:19,759 --> 00:07:20,839
I think so.

138
00:07:21,480 --> 00:07:22,199
Could you let me check

139
00:07:22,199 --> 00:07:23,279
his payment history?

140
00:07:23,600 --> 00:07:24,120
Sure, sure.

141
00:07:27,079 --> 00:07:27,560
Here.

142
00:07:30,120 --> 00:07:30,480
Take a look.

143
00:07:35,920 --> 00:07:37,680
On the 12th of last month,

144
00:07:39,279 --> 00:07:40,959
it was a Friday night.

145
00:07:41,399 --> 00:07:43,560
Right, that should be him.

146
00:07:44,160 --> 00:07:44,839
Because

147
00:07:45,399 --> 00:07:46,240
that night,

148
00:07:46,240 --> 00:07:47,720
he was the last customer to buy anything.

149
00:08:42,080 --> 00:08:43,879
It's just a meeting. Why bring so many people?

150
00:08:44,159 --> 00:08:45,240
Aren't you afraid of drawing attention?

151
00:08:45,679 --> 00:08:46,840
Precisely because I am,

152
00:08:47,240 --> 00:08:48,759
that's why I brought so many.

153
00:08:50,080 --> 00:08:51,080
Have you found Qian Feng yet?

154
00:08:52,919 --> 00:08:54,759
If even the police can't find him,

155
00:08:55,360 --> 00:08:56,919
how easy do you think it'll be?

156
00:08:57,360 --> 00:08:59,440
We have to find him before the police do.

157
00:08:59,559 --> 00:09:01,440
If the logistics company route gets cut off,

158
00:09:02,279 --> 00:09:03,600
none of the shipments will get through.

159
00:09:06,200 --> 00:09:09,159
You've always been in charge of the Zhongtian line.

160
00:09:09,759 --> 00:09:10,759
Now that there's trouble,

161
00:09:10,759 --> 00:09:12,120
are you trying to drag

162
00:09:12,120 --> 00:09:13,080
the rest of us down with you?

163
00:09:14,279 --> 00:09:16,440
We're all in the same boat now.

164
00:09:16,840 --> 00:09:18,480
Several major buyers in the northwest

165
00:09:18,639 --> 00:09:19,960
are waiting on our delivery.

166
00:09:21,200 --> 00:09:22,159
We need to hurry.

167
00:09:23,759 --> 00:09:26,440
The cops definitely have their eyes on Zhongtian now.

168
00:09:26,840 --> 00:09:28,759
Even if we find that punk,

169
00:09:28,799 --> 00:09:31,039
this route might not be safe anymore.

170
00:09:31,039 --> 00:09:32,639
Just focus on doing your part.

171
00:09:33,080 --> 00:09:34,279
I'll handle the rest.

172
00:09:35,399 --> 00:09:36,440
You'll handle it?

173
00:09:36,879 --> 00:09:39,639
The cops can investigate you whenever they want.

174
00:09:40,080 --> 00:09:41,159
How are you going to handle it?

175
00:09:42,519 --> 00:09:45,440
Ever heard of sacrificing a pawn to save the king?

176
00:10:14,080 --> 00:10:15,000
We outnumber them.

177
00:10:15,639 --> 00:10:16,960
Why should we be afraid of them?

178
00:10:18,519 --> 00:10:19,399
What good are numbers?

179
00:10:22,399 --> 00:10:24,360
The reason Li Qiang and Four-Legged Snake act so cocky

180
00:10:24,519 --> 00:10:25,879
is because they have guns.

181
00:10:28,480 --> 00:10:30,519
Dana, contact that guy Flying Fish right away

182
00:10:30,919 --> 00:10:31,840
and have him get us some guns.

183
00:10:35,279 --> 00:10:36,159
Once we have guns,

184
00:10:36,279 --> 00:10:37,679
how business is run on this turf

185
00:10:37,679 --> 00:10:38,519
and who we deal with

186
00:10:38,679 --> 00:10:39,759
will all be my call.

187
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:50,720
What's wrong, brother?

188
00:10:51,679 --> 00:10:52,879
Didn't I already give you who you wanted?

189
00:10:55,120 --> 00:10:56,120
Ever heard of Zhao Xinjie?

190
00:10:56,519 --> 00:10:57,960
I looked into it. She's not your biological sister.

191
00:10:57,960 --> 00:10:59,559
She's closer to me than my own sister.

192
00:10:59,559 --> 00:11:00,679
Why did you get her hooked on drugs?

193
00:11:01,639 --> 00:11:02,799
Me? Get her hooked on drugs?

194
00:11:02,799 --> 00:11:04,360
Xu Na said you did it.

195
00:11:04,360 --> 00:11:04,919
Bullshit!

196
00:11:04,919 --> 00:11:06,480
Bring her over and let's confront her.

197
00:11:07,399 --> 00:11:08,480
Did you instruct Xu Na

198
00:11:08,480 --> 00:11:09,480
to set a trap for my sister?

199
00:11:10,840 --> 00:11:12,360
I have no idea what you're talking about.

200
00:11:12,759 --> 00:11:14,519
Xu Na is just some punk girl to me.

201
00:11:14,679 --> 00:11:16,159
How would I know what she does?

202
00:11:16,360 --> 00:11:17,360
Bullshit!

203
00:11:22,200 --> 00:11:24,720
Fine, I'll take the blame for your sister.

204
00:11:24,720 --> 00:11:25,919
Can money settle this?

205
00:11:26,600 --> 00:11:27,279
Name your price.

206
00:11:28,759 --> 00:11:31,039
You can't afford it.

207
00:11:31,120 --> 00:11:32,759
As long as money can solve it,

208
00:11:32,759 --> 00:11:33,960
it's not a problem at all.

209
00:11:45,320 --> 00:11:45,840
Just this much?

210
00:11:47,039 --> 00:11:48,000
Who are you looking down on?

211
00:11:48,960 --> 00:11:50,279
It's just a greeting gift.

212
00:11:51,559 --> 00:11:52,440
Come work for me.

213
00:11:54,200 --> 00:11:55,519
I can tell you know how to fight.

214
00:11:55,679 --> 00:11:57,000
Do you know what business I'm in?

215
00:11:58,440 --> 00:11:58,919
Yeah.

216
00:12:00,080 --> 00:12:02,320
What you saw is just the tip of the iceberg.

217
00:12:02,519 --> 00:12:03,279
Work for me,

218
00:12:03,399 --> 00:12:05,799
and you'll make at least a million a year.

219
00:12:12,320 --> 00:12:13,639
What? Think my place is too small for you?

220
00:12:18,320 --> 00:12:19,399
I can work for you.

221
00:12:19,559 --> 00:12:20,679
But as for me,

222
00:12:21,159 --> 00:12:22,399
I like to keep things simple.

223
00:12:23,080 --> 00:12:23,799
Just two rules.

224
00:12:24,279 --> 00:12:27,559
First, strictly business, no friendship.

225
00:12:28,200 --> 00:12:28,720
Second,

226
00:12:28,960 --> 00:12:30,919
once I make what I want, I'm out.

227
00:12:30,960 --> 00:12:31,519
I like your style.

228
00:12:32,960 --> 00:12:33,799
I agree.

229
00:12:33,840 --> 00:12:35,639
I can tell you're built for big things.

230
00:12:38,279 --> 00:12:38,720
All right.

231
00:12:39,440 --> 00:12:41,080
Then if you need anything, Boss Liang,

232
00:12:41,080 --> 00:12:42,000
just say the word.

233
00:12:42,440 --> 00:12:45,000
Our past grudges are wiped clean.

234
00:12:47,919 --> 00:12:48,919
Thank you, Boss Liang.

235
00:13:00,879 --> 00:13:03,000
Boss, what are you thinking?

236
00:13:03,200 --> 00:13:04,840
That punk is way too cocky.

237
00:13:05,519 --> 00:13:06,840
Maybe he and that Zhao Xinjie

238
00:13:07,039 --> 00:13:07,919
aren't even that close.

239
00:13:08,519 --> 00:13:09,639
Always going on about his "sister."

240
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:12,240
I bet he's just trying to shake you down.

241
00:13:12,559 --> 00:13:14,600
If only he just wanted money.

242
00:13:18,120 --> 00:13:18,679
That's enough.

243
00:13:18,679 --> 00:13:19,879
You two go dig into his background right now.

244
00:13:20,480 --> 00:13:21,120
Got it, Boss.

245
00:13:30,080 --> 00:13:30,840
Anything else?

246
00:13:32,039 --> 00:13:32,480
Nothing.

247
00:13:33,440 --> 00:13:34,240
Scram.

248
00:13:34,480 --> 00:13:35,320
Right away, right away.

249
00:13:54,799 --> 00:13:55,240
President Li.

250
00:13:58,440 --> 00:13:59,840
Director Zhou told me

251
00:14:00,360 --> 00:14:01,360
the police are here again.

252
00:14:01,559 --> 00:14:01,919
Yes.

253
00:14:02,159 --> 00:14:03,759
They're in Director Zhou's office right now.

254
00:14:03,879 --> 00:14:05,360
Should I invite them to your office?

255
00:14:05,360 --> 00:14:06,759
No need. I'll go see them.

256
00:14:14,000 --> 00:14:16,000
Officers, thank you for your hard work.

257
00:14:16,759 --> 00:14:18,159
This is President Li of our branch,

258
00:14:18,320 --> 00:14:19,639
the head of operations here.

259
00:14:19,799 --> 00:14:20,200
Li Guoyao.

260
00:14:20,440 --> 00:14:20,879
Hello.

261
00:14:21,519 --> 00:14:22,519
Thank you for your hard work.

262
00:14:23,080 --> 00:14:24,000
Please, have a seat.

263
00:14:26,440 --> 00:14:27,120
Here's the situation.

264
00:14:27,840 --> 00:14:28,679
Well...

265
00:14:29,039 --> 00:14:32,200
I only just learned about this drug case myself.

266
00:14:33,240 --> 00:14:35,840
Even with our strict management,

267
00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:37,679
lapses can still happen despite our best efforts.

268
00:14:37,679 --> 00:14:39,320
Sorry to cause you two so much trouble.

269
00:14:41,360 --> 00:14:42,679
Whatever help you need from us,

270
00:14:42,840 --> 00:14:43,600
just say the word.

271
00:14:45,159 --> 00:14:46,600
Right now, our employees

272
00:14:46,600 --> 00:14:49,080
are panicked and gossiping.

273
00:14:49,240 --> 00:14:50,679
Some are even saying

274
00:14:51,240 --> 00:14:53,799
this case involves an insider

275
00:14:53,799 --> 00:14:55,519
at our logistics company.

276
00:14:56,120 --> 00:14:58,279
So I really hope you two

277
00:14:58,960 --> 00:15:00,360
can clear this up as soon as possible,

278
00:15:00,360 --> 00:15:03,120
and restore normal operations to our company.

279
00:15:03,200 --> 00:15:03,960
Rest assured, sir.

280
00:15:04,399 --> 00:15:05,360
We'll do everything we can.

281
00:15:05,559 --> 00:15:06,840
Great. Thank you so much.

282
00:15:07,399 --> 00:15:08,639
Tell you what, Secretary Wang.

283
00:15:09,440 --> 00:15:09,919
Make arrangements.

284
00:15:09,919 --> 00:15:10,440
At noon,

285
00:15:10,600 --> 00:15:12,840
let's treat the officers to a simple lunch.

286
00:15:13,120 --> 00:15:13,639
That won't be necessary.

287
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:14,840
Please, I insist.

288
00:15:15,159 --> 00:15:16,639
Thank you, then.

289
00:15:16,639 --> 00:15:17,120
All right.

290
00:15:22,600 --> 00:15:23,919
President Li is being so hospitable,

291
00:15:24,159 --> 00:15:25,679
we can't turn him down, can we?

292
00:15:27,000 --> 00:15:27,399
How about this:

293
00:15:28,840 --> 00:15:30,759
we have lunch a bit earlier today.

294
00:15:31,240 --> 00:15:32,120
As for these files,

295
00:15:32,159 --> 00:15:33,120
I need to take them back to the squad.

296
00:15:33,360 --> 00:15:34,440
Would that be all right with you, President Li?

297
00:15:35,960 --> 00:15:37,159
Of course, not a problem at all!

298
00:15:37,200 --> 00:15:38,639
Didn't I just say?

299
00:15:39,120 --> 00:15:40,600
Whatever you need us to do,

300
00:15:40,639 --> 00:15:42,000
we'll fully cooperate.

301
00:16:01,399 --> 00:16:02,519
Find anything?

302
00:16:05,879 --> 00:16:07,000
Nothing at all.

303
00:16:17,919 --> 00:16:21,279
This guy just plays video games and sleeps all day.

304
00:16:22,080 --> 00:16:23,519
He was just threatened yesterday,

305
00:16:23,519 --> 00:16:24,639
and today he slept in until noon.

306
00:16:24,639 --> 00:16:25,919
He doesn't have a care in the world.

307
00:16:27,200 --> 00:16:27,639
By the way,

308
00:16:28,200 --> 00:16:29,399
didn't he say he was a DJ?

309
00:16:29,679 --> 00:16:30,879
How come I never see him go out at night?

310
00:16:31,919 --> 00:16:32,759
Beats me.

311
00:16:33,399 --> 00:16:34,200
He's probably full of it.

312
00:16:48,960 --> 00:16:49,799
Who is it?

313
00:16:50,519 --> 00:16:51,519
It's me, Elvis.

314
00:16:51,960 --> 00:16:52,720
Elvis?

315
00:16:54,440 --> 00:16:55,879
Why is it so noisy over there?

316
00:16:56,840 --> 00:16:58,559
William Han's success seminar.

317
00:16:58,600 --> 00:16:59,559
I'm right here at the venue.

318
00:17:00,720 --> 00:17:02,399
You've never seen fans like this.

319
00:17:02,559 --> 00:17:04,119
It feels like a celebrity fan meet.

320
00:17:05,519 --> 00:17:06,359
What do you need?

321
00:17:07,400 --> 00:17:08,400
Didn't you ask me last time

322
00:17:08,400 --> 00:17:09,880
to hook you up with a big buyer?

323
00:17:10,160 --> 00:17:12,079
I've lined someone up for you.

324
00:17:13,000 --> 00:17:13,839
You found someone?

325
00:17:14,680 --> 00:17:15,319
Who is he?

326
00:17:15,920 --> 00:17:16,559
Is he reliable?

327
00:17:17,160 --> 00:17:18,119
Totally solid.

328
00:17:18,279 --> 00:17:19,839
He specializes in moving gear in this scene.

329
00:17:20,279 --> 00:17:21,200
He's in town

330
00:17:21,400 --> 00:17:23,079
to work alongside William Han's seminar.

331
00:17:23,759 --> 00:17:24,720
He's leaving next week.

332
00:17:25,000 --> 00:17:25,599
Are you in or out?

333
00:17:28,839 --> 00:17:30,160
How much can he take?

334
00:17:31,720 --> 00:17:32,960
The guy's got deep pockets.

335
00:17:33,119 --> 00:17:34,880
He can take whatever you have.

336
00:17:35,359 --> 00:17:36,480
Let me tell you,

337
00:17:37,000 --> 00:17:37,880
this guy...

338
00:17:38,119 --> 00:17:39,319
It took a lot of effort to connect with him.

339
00:17:39,519 --> 00:17:40,519
Don't mess this up for me.

340
00:17:40,759 --> 00:17:42,559
All right, I'll call you later.

341
00:17:51,440 --> 00:17:52,400
I'm looking for Brother Qiang.

342
00:17:59,079 --> 00:18:01,000
Well, as the saying goes,

343
00:18:01,160 --> 00:18:02,279
no feast is complete without drinks.

344
00:18:02,359 --> 00:18:05,160
Besides, the police and the public are one family.

345
00:18:05,720 --> 00:18:06,359
Pour the drinks.

346
00:18:06,680 --> 00:18:08,079
Let's all share a toast together.

347
00:18:08,240 --> 00:18:08,799
Right, absolutely.

348
00:18:09,319 --> 00:18:09,680
Cheers.

349
00:18:11,759 --> 00:18:12,759
I'm sorry, Mr. Li.

350
00:18:13,400 --> 00:18:14,480
At all times,

351
00:18:14,519 --> 00:18:15,480
we're strictly forbidden to drink.

352
00:18:18,640 --> 00:18:19,000
Fair enough.

353
00:18:19,839 --> 00:18:20,640
No drinks it is.

354
00:18:20,799 --> 00:18:22,920
You officers have your principles.

355
00:18:24,359 --> 00:18:26,480
Then let's not just sit here.

356
00:18:26,480 --> 00:18:27,240
Come on, dig in.

357
00:18:27,720 --> 00:18:28,480
Help yourselves.

358
00:18:29,839 --> 00:18:31,319
So, Officer Zhuang,

359
00:18:32,720 --> 00:18:34,880
that suspect you arrested...

360
00:18:35,519 --> 00:18:36,839
What was her name, Gao something?

361
00:18:37,039 --> 00:18:37,599
Gao Min.

362
00:18:37,680 --> 00:18:39,160
Right, Gao Min.

363
00:18:39,880 --> 00:18:42,359
Has she confessed everything by now?

364
00:18:45,640 --> 00:18:46,559
I'm sorry, Mr. Li.

365
00:18:46,759 --> 00:18:48,759
Any information regarding our case

366
00:18:48,920 --> 00:18:49,880
cannot be disclosed.

367
00:18:51,319 --> 00:18:53,359
Mr. Li, look at what you just asked.

368
00:18:53,920 --> 00:18:54,599
That's out of line.

369
00:18:55,640 --> 00:18:56,720
What these two officers handle

370
00:18:56,799 --> 00:18:57,880
is classified work.

371
00:18:58,680 --> 00:19:00,799
Right, classified work, of course.

372
00:19:00,960 --> 00:19:01,799
Look at me, my mistake.

373
00:19:01,960 --> 00:19:03,240
To apologize for my slip of the tongue,

374
00:19:03,519 --> 00:19:04,759
I'll take a penalty drink.

375
00:19:04,759 --> 00:19:06,359
Consider it my humble apology.

376
00:19:08,079 --> 00:19:10,039
Mr. Li, tonight's dinner

377
00:19:10,119 --> 00:19:11,759
is a bit too lavish for us.

378
00:19:12,599 --> 00:19:13,559
We have strict discipline to follow,

379
00:19:13,759 --> 00:19:15,200
so we really can't accept this meal.

380
00:19:15,839 --> 00:19:16,880
We still have duties to attend to,

381
00:19:16,880 --> 00:19:17,759
so we'll take our leave.

382
00:19:18,920 --> 00:19:19,319
Officers...

383
00:19:19,839 --> 00:19:21,039
Please, wait a moment!

384
00:19:22,200 --> 00:19:22,559
Secretary Wang.

385
00:19:30,079 --> 00:19:32,680
These two gifts were prepared especially for you.

386
00:19:33,440 --> 00:19:35,400
Thank you for working so tirelessly

387
00:19:36,000 --> 00:19:38,519
to clear our company of suspicion.

388
00:19:39,400 --> 00:19:41,400
It was also our poor management

389
00:19:41,920 --> 00:19:43,279
that caused you so much trouble.

390
00:19:43,400 --> 00:19:45,000
So these two gifts...

391
00:19:45,079 --> 00:19:46,839
are a small token of my apology.

392
00:19:48,039 --> 00:19:49,880
Mr. Li, our police force has strict discipline.

393
00:19:50,200 --> 00:19:52,279
We can never accept gifts under any circumstances.

394
00:19:57,200 --> 00:19:59,599
This Trojan banquet... Mr. Li is sharp.

395
00:20:00,720 --> 00:20:02,440
They just want to feel us out.

396
00:20:02,960 --> 00:20:03,759
Feel us out?

397
00:20:04,279 --> 00:20:05,000
About what?

398
00:20:05,119 --> 00:20:06,480
What he's worried about right now

399
00:20:07,039 --> 00:20:08,359
is that we'll use this case

400
00:20:08,519 --> 00:20:09,759
as a reason to investigate his company.

401
00:20:11,720 --> 00:20:13,839
But as the head of an enterprise,

402
00:20:14,079 --> 00:20:15,880
wanting to protect its public image

403
00:20:16,240 --> 00:20:17,359
is completely natural.

404
00:20:18,160 --> 00:20:19,400
It's not that simple.

405
00:20:19,920 --> 00:20:21,319
This guy isn't just sly;

406
00:20:21,319 --> 00:20:22,240
he's a veteran schemer.

407
00:20:22,559 --> 00:20:23,839
That move of gifting a commemorative album...

408
00:20:23,839 --> 00:20:25,279
isn't something an ordinary person would think of.

409
00:20:26,720 --> 00:20:27,680
Though at first, I really thought

410
00:20:27,680 --> 00:20:28,920
he had stuffed it with cash.

411
00:20:30,000 --> 00:20:32,319
Then what was the point of giving an album?

412
00:20:32,759 --> 00:20:34,079
It's called testing the waters.

413
00:20:34,319 --> 00:20:35,759
He's testing our moral baseline.

414
00:20:37,000 --> 00:20:38,359
If we had blindly accepted it

415
00:20:38,359 --> 00:20:39,519
without asking questions,

416
00:20:40,039 --> 00:20:40,960
then next time,

417
00:20:41,319 --> 00:20:42,960
it would've been a box packed with cash.

418
00:20:49,119 --> 00:20:49,880
Guan Qiang.

419
00:20:50,640 --> 00:20:51,680
I found the Alipay account.

420
00:20:53,119 --> 00:20:54,400
We tracked down the Alipay account.

421
00:20:56,759 --> 00:20:57,279
Alright, got it.

422
00:21:00,480 --> 00:21:02,359
This is Qian Feng's Alipay statement.

423
00:21:02,839 --> 00:21:04,039
Several Alipay accounts

424
00:21:04,039 --> 00:21:06,000
have been transferring large sums to it irregularly.

425
00:21:06,359 --> 00:21:07,200
What's more, this money

426
00:21:07,200 --> 00:21:09,000
was ultimately transferred to Li Xia's bank card.

427
00:21:09,200 --> 00:21:11,279
We checked Li Xia's bank statements.

428
00:21:11,519 --> 00:21:12,880
There are several small expenses in there

429
00:21:12,880 --> 00:21:14,079
for purchasing feminine products.

430
00:21:14,440 --> 00:21:15,400
So we're certain

431
00:21:15,480 --> 00:21:17,359
this card is currently in Li Xia's possession.

432
00:21:19,720 --> 00:21:20,960
In other words,

433
00:21:21,079 --> 00:21:23,079
Qian Feng is using Alipay

434
00:21:23,279 --> 00:21:24,440
to transfer the money to Li Xia.

435
00:21:24,759 --> 00:21:25,480
You could say that.

436
00:21:25,960 --> 00:21:28,119
Then Qian Feng's relationship with Li Xia

437
00:21:28,119 --> 00:21:29,079
is definitely unusual.

438
00:21:29,759 --> 00:21:30,519
We suspect

439
00:21:30,680 --> 00:21:32,480
the people transferring large sums to Qian Feng

440
00:21:32,839 --> 00:21:33,799
are likely his downlines.

441
00:21:33,920 --> 00:21:35,079
And that woman named Li Xia

442
00:21:35,119 --> 00:21:36,920
is likely the one managing his drug funds.

443
00:21:38,480 --> 00:21:39,640
A week before this batch

444
00:21:39,640 --> 00:21:40,839
of drug-laden masks was seized,

445
00:21:41,119 --> 00:21:42,440
a sum of 150,000

446
00:21:42,880 --> 00:21:44,799
was transferred to Qian Feng's account in three parts.

447
00:21:45,319 --> 00:21:46,480
We suspect this money

448
00:21:46,599 --> 00:21:48,240
was a downline's payment to Qian Feng.

449
00:21:48,599 --> 00:21:49,799
And three days ago,

450
00:21:49,960 --> 00:21:51,839
this payment was already deposited

451
00:21:51,839 --> 00:21:52,680
into Li Xia's account.

452
00:21:53,880 --> 00:21:56,200
From our analysis of the current evidence,

453
00:21:57,000 --> 00:21:59,200
Qian Feng and Wu Liang

454
00:21:59,440 --> 00:22:00,759
hold very similar positions

455
00:22:00,759 --> 00:22:01,519
in the drug trafficking network.

456
00:22:02,279 --> 00:22:05,039
It's just that Qian Feng seems much more cautious.

457
00:22:05,079 --> 00:22:07,920
Because the way he contacts his network

458
00:22:08,480 --> 00:22:09,640
seems completely different.

459
00:22:10,079 --> 00:22:11,119
Wu Liang was a thug,

460
00:22:11,839 --> 00:22:13,960
but Qian Feng is more like a professional manager.

461
00:22:13,960 --> 00:22:14,400
Captain Bai.

462
00:22:15,119 --> 00:22:16,759
Li Xia's identity details and home address

463
00:22:16,759 --> 00:22:17,400
have been located.

464
00:22:17,440 --> 00:22:18,920
She lives in Taihe Garden.

465
00:22:19,240 --> 00:22:20,559
But her phone's GPS shows

466
00:22:21,039 --> 00:22:22,720
she's at Nanhai Commercial Bank,

467
00:22:23,039 --> 00:22:23,799
Taihe Road branch.

468
00:22:24,079 --> 00:22:26,000
Li Xia often withdraws cash from this branch.

469
00:22:26,039 --> 00:22:27,279
You mean

470
00:22:28,240 --> 00:22:30,599
Li Xia might be withdrawing drug money right now?

471
00:22:31,079 --> 00:22:31,839
It's very possible.

472
00:22:33,039 --> 00:22:34,480
Split into two teams. Head to the bank!

473
00:23:13,200 --> 00:23:14,240
I already made an appointment by phone.

474
00:23:14,240 --> 00:23:15,279
Can't you serve me first?

475
00:23:15,359 --> 00:23:15,759
Hello, sir.

476
00:23:15,759 --> 00:23:17,319
All large cash withdrawals were booked in advance.

477
00:23:17,400 --> 00:23:18,960
We have a lot of customers today.

478
00:23:18,960 --> 00:23:20,640
Please be patient and wait your turn.

479
00:23:44,319 --> 00:23:45,799
All right, got it.

480
00:23:46,319 --> 00:23:47,680
Send the files to Li Xiao right away.

481
00:23:50,759 --> 00:23:51,200
Captain Bai,

482
00:23:51,720 --> 00:23:53,400
the person negotiating the drug deal with Xu Duoduo

483
00:23:53,400 --> 00:23:54,000
is named Li Yawei.

484
00:23:54,519 --> 00:23:55,319
He goes by Elvis.

485
00:23:55,559 --> 00:23:57,680
He runs a local cultural media company.

486
00:23:57,759 --> 00:23:59,759
At William Han's success seminar,

487
00:23:59,839 --> 00:24:00,480
he's handling PR.

488
00:24:00,640 --> 00:24:02,079
The buyer behind the scenes Li Yawei mentioned

489
00:24:02,599 --> 00:24:04,519
could be William Han's manager,

490
00:24:04,519 --> 00:24:05,160
named Mu Qing.

491
00:24:08,160 --> 00:24:11,200
Has Xu Duoduo confirmed with Li Qiang

492
00:24:11,200 --> 00:24:12,680
the time and place for the deal?

493
00:24:13,480 --> 00:24:14,680
They were in touch once recently.

494
00:24:15,240 --> 00:24:17,279
Li Qiang keeps saying he'll arrange it,

495
00:24:17,279 --> 00:24:19,400
but there hasn't been any movement yet.

496
00:24:22,319 --> 00:24:23,279
Tell Li Xiao to keep a close eye on them.

497
00:24:23,599 --> 00:24:24,440
If anything comes up,

498
00:24:25,079 --> 00:24:26,079
report it immediately.

499
00:24:26,680 --> 00:24:28,160
What about the seminar?

500
00:24:28,160 --> 00:24:29,279
Should we have someone watch it?

501
00:24:29,559 --> 00:24:30,720
William Han is a public figure.

502
00:24:32,079 --> 00:24:33,559
If we move too early,

503
00:24:34,400 --> 00:24:35,839
the media will likely catch wind of it.

504
00:24:36,799 --> 00:24:39,359
Besides, Li Qiang is the supplier.

505
00:24:40,119 --> 00:24:41,640
He's our key to cracking the case.

506
00:24:41,960 --> 00:24:43,359
Until we get new leads,

507
00:24:44,640 --> 00:24:45,920
don't make any moves.

508
00:24:55,039 --> 00:25:00,359
Number A119, please proceed to Counter Three.

509
00:25:01,480 --> 00:25:06,799
Number A119, please proceed to Counter Three.

510
00:25:15,039 --> 00:25:15,400
Hello.

511
00:25:15,759 --> 00:25:17,640
Hello, how can I help you today?

512
00:25:17,920 --> 00:25:19,079
I made an appointment to withdraw 200,000.

513
00:25:19,079 --> 00:25:19,680
Thank you.

514
00:25:20,039 --> 00:25:20,599
All right.

515
00:25:38,920 --> 00:25:40,839
Tao, how much longer till we get there?

516
00:25:41,079 --> 00:25:41,880
Another 5.6 kilometers.

517
00:25:42,400 --> 00:25:44,119
But there's an accident up ahead,

518
00:25:44,279 --> 00:25:45,240
so traffic will be backed up.

519
00:25:48,759 --> 00:25:50,359
Zhuang Yan's team is two intersections away.

520
00:25:50,759 --> 00:25:51,240
Traffic was bad,

521
00:25:51,440 --> 00:25:52,279
so they got out and ran over.

522
00:25:53,480 --> 00:25:54,039
How much longer?

523
00:25:55,119 --> 00:25:56,240
Three more red lights ahead.

524
00:25:56,279 --> 00:25:57,680
At least another ten minutes by car.

525
00:26:01,599 --> 00:26:02,640
Call the bank manager.

526
00:26:02,839 --> 00:26:03,240
On it.

527
00:26:06,119 --> 00:26:07,359
Could you please hurry it up?

528
00:26:07,519 --> 00:26:07,880
Right away.

529
00:26:08,359 --> 00:26:09,920
Here, please sign right here.

530
00:26:15,119 --> 00:26:15,720
Thank you.

531
00:26:39,559 --> 00:26:40,160
Hello?

532
00:26:44,079 --> 00:26:44,440
Okay.

533
00:26:45,079 --> 00:26:46,839
Sorry, please give me a second.

534
00:27:06,160 --> 00:27:06,559
Hello.

535
00:27:06,759 --> 00:27:07,039
Hello.

536
00:27:07,039 --> 00:27:08,559
Regarding the funds you want to withdraw,

537
00:27:08,559 --> 00:27:09,720
we're already preparing them.

538
00:27:10,039 --> 00:27:11,559
However, due to an internal bank issue,

539
00:27:11,759 --> 00:27:13,079
we need you to wait a little longer.

540
00:27:13,920 --> 00:27:15,359
Please hurry up, thank you.

541
00:27:15,359 --> 00:27:16,000
Understood. My apologies.

542
00:27:16,200 --> 00:27:16,920
Just a moment longer, please.

543
00:28:03,720 --> 00:28:05,319
Sorry, I won't be picking it up today. Thanks.

544
00:28:05,319 --> 00:28:05,640
Miss.

545
00:28:06,200 --> 00:28:07,200
Wait a minute, miss.

546
00:28:10,480 --> 00:28:11,000
Freeze!

547
00:28:11,519 --> 00:28:12,480
Police. Come with us.

548
00:28:12,480 --> 00:28:12,960
Why are you grabbing me?

549
00:28:13,160 --> 00:28:13,839
Let go of me!

550
00:28:13,960 --> 00:28:14,920
Why are you arresting me?!

551
00:28:15,119 --> 00:28:16,000
What are you arresting me for?!

552
00:28:19,640 --> 00:28:21,480
Li Xia, you're suspected of drug trafficking.

553
00:28:21,480 --> 00:28:22,240
Drug trafficking?

554
00:28:22,839 --> 00:28:23,400
What are you talking about?

555
00:28:23,400 --> 00:28:24,279
Do you have any evidence?

556
00:28:24,440 --> 00:28:26,359
We're bringing you in to assist with an investigation.

557
00:28:38,680 --> 00:28:39,279
Qian Feng.

558
00:28:43,599 --> 00:28:44,079
It's Zhuang Yan.

559
00:28:53,160 --> 00:28:53,759
Freeze!

560
00:29:30,640 --> 00:29:31,039
Zhuang Yan,

561
00:29:31,119 --> 00:29:31,559
are you okay?

562
00:29:41,559 --> 00:29:42,039
Boss,

563
00:29:43,000 --> 00:29:44,359
isn't that kid putting on way too many airs?

564
00:29:44,720 --> 00:29:45,599
Making you go pick him up in person?

565
00:29:46,160 --> 00:29:47,359
Do we really need to treat him with such respect?

566
00:29:47,880 --> 00:29:49,119
It was my idea to pick him up.

567
00:29:49,440 --> 00:29:52,519
Brother Biao, Right Bank Residence is a serviced apartment building.

568
00:29:52,599 --> 00:29:53,279
The people living there

569
00:29:53,279 --> 00:29:55,039
are mostly single white-collar workers.

570
00:29:55,559 --> 00:29:57,680
They don't usually interact with each other.

571
00:29:58,440 --> 00:29:59,279
I asked a few people,

572
00:29:59,279 --> 00:30:00,559
and none of them knew the kid.

573
00:30:00,960 --> 00:30:01,599
Luckily, though,

574
00:30:01,599 --> 00:30:02,759
the security guard at the front gate

575
00:30:02,920 --> 00:30:04,160
knew a bit about him.

576
00:30:05,000 --> 00:30:07,359
Said he was discharged from the army less than six months ago,

577
00:30:07,680 --> 00:30:09,519
doesn't have a steady job,

578
00:30:09,599 --> 00:30:11,279
and people are always coming over demanding money from him.

579
00:30:11,480 --> 00:30:12,200
The way I see it,

580
00:30:12,720 --> 00:30:15,200
he just wants to make some quick cash with you.

581
00:30:16,880 --> 00:30:17,519
But Boss,

582
00:30:18,200 --> 00:30:19,440
I still feel something's off.

583
00:30:20,079 --> 00:30:21,119
When this kid mentioned his sister

584
00:30:21,119 --> 00:30:22,240
getting hooked on drugs,

585
00:30:22,400 --> 00:30:23,240
wasn't he furious about it?

586
00:30:23,599 --> 00:30:24,039
Now that he knows

587
00:30:24,039 --> 00:30:25,119
we're in the same line of business,

588
00:30:25,559 --> 00:30:27,519
why would he still want to work with us?

589
00:30:28,839 --> 00:30:31,240
Money makes the world go round.

590
00:30:32,720 --> 00:30:34,640
If there's money to be made, why wouldn't he?

591
00:30:35,440 --> 00:30:37,440
I think we'd better be careful.

592
00:30:38,160 --> 00:30:40,440
Didn't that kid serve in the military?

593
00:30:41,039 --> 00:30:43,720
What if he's a cop now?

594
00:30:49,559 --> 00:30:52,759
That's definitely a possibility.

595
00:30:55,799 --> 00:30:56,240
Here's what we'll do.

596
00:30:57,839 --> 00:31:00,119
We'll test the kid again tonight.

597
00:31:01,079 --> 00:31:02,759
Also, you two need to track down

598
00:31:02,759 --> 00:31:04,160
his sister's whereabouts as soon as possible.

599
00:31:04,519 --> 00:31:05,119
His sister?

600
00:31:06,319 --> 00:31:07,680
Didn't he say he sent his sister

601
00:31:07,680 --> 00:31:08,880
back to their hometown?

602
00:31:10,759 --> 00:31:11,920
I doubt it's that simple.

603
00:31:12,319 --> 00:31:13,759
That kid plays his cards close to his chest.

604
00:31:14,119 --> 00:31:17,240
He won't reveal his hand easily.

605
00:31:18,000 --> 00:31:19,079
If he weren't such a good fighter,

606
00:31:19,839 --> 00:31:20,799
I wouldn't even use him.

607
00:31:21,920 --> 00:31:23,039
If there really is something wrong with him,

608
00:31:23,920 --> 00:31:24,680
that's fine too.

609
00:31:25,119 --> 00:31:27,079
I'll just treat him as an attack dog

610
00:31:27,079 --> 00:31:29,119
I took in for a while.

611
00:31:45,279 --> 00:31:45,759
Ah Kai.

612
00:31:46,880 --> 00:31:47,400
Where are we going?

613
00:31:48,079 --> 00:31:49,599
Why ask so many questions?

614
00:31:49,799 --> 00:31:51,359
I'm taking you to broaden your horizons.

615
00:31:51,599 --> 00:31:52,240
Get in, get in.

616
00:31:53,400 --> 00:31:54,720
Then thank you in advance, Boss Liang.

617
00:32:09,319 --> 00:32:10,839
I've known Qian Feng

618
00:32:11,279 --> 00:32:12,319
for less than a year.

619
00:32:13,240 --> 00:32:14,119
He gave me so much—

620
00:32:14,119 --> 00:32:15,799
the care I'd always craved.

621
00:32:17,359 --> 00:32:18,319
I suspected early on

622
00:32:18,759 --> 00:32:20,240
that what he did might be illegal,

623
00:32:22,799 --> 00:32:23,559
but I didn't care.

624
00:32:28,319 --> 00:32:29,400
Did it ever occur to you

625
00:32:29,640 --> 00:32:30,599
that your lack of care

626
00:32:31,119 --> 00:32:32,680
would lead you down a path of no return?

627
00:32:41,880 --> 00:32:42,799
I never thought about that.

628
00:32:43,640 --> 00:32:44,680
I just felt

629
00:32:44,799 --> 00:32:46,559
he was worth giving everything for.

630
00:32:50,720 --> 00:32:52,519
From what we know,

631
00:32:52,640 --> 00:32:54,079
you're not single.

632
00:32:54,279 --> 00:32:55,839
You have a husband and a child.

633
00:32:56,240 --> 00:32:59,000
Do you think doing this,

634
00:32:59,279 --> 00:33:00,559
and saying these things to us,

635
00:33:01,279 --> 00:33:01,920
is appropriate?

636
00:33:02,680 --> 00:33:03,440
I know.

637
00:33:04,200 --> 00:33:06,000
People might look down on me now,

638
00:33:06,160 --> 00:33:06,920
or even despise me.

639
00:33:07,519 --> 00:33:08,640
But I don't regret it.

640
00:33:10,319 --> 00:33:11,359
In this life,

641
00:33:11,640 --> 00:33:12,880
everyone wants different things.

642
00:33:13,079 --> 00:33:13,680
And as for me,

643
00:33:14,680 --> 00:33:16,119
love always comes first.

644
00:33:16,960 --> 00:33:19,319
I think if a woman

645
00:33:19,559 --> 00:33:20,960
can experience one romance in her life

646
00:33:20,960 --> 00:33:22,119
without any regrets,

647
00:33:23,759 --> 00:33:24,279
that's enough.

648
00:33:27,200 --> 00:33:29,519
She's watched way too many soap operas.

649
00:33:33,759 --> 00:33:34,880
You just don't get it.

650
00:33:36,119 --> 00:33:37,480
Deep down, every woman

651
00:33:38,480 --> 00:33:40,359
dreams of a beautiful romance.

652
00:33:41,519 --> 00:33:42,960
Even if that kind of longing

653
00:33:43,400 --> 00:33:45,720
seems a bit naive in reality,

654
00:33:47,240 --> 00:33:49,200
it's still the sweetest dream she has.

655
00:33:50,799 --> 00:33:52,200
It's just a shame that in this world,

656
00:33:53,000 --> 00:33:53,880
there are plenty of Cinderellas,

657
00:33:54,319 --> 00:33:55,279
but very few princes.

658
00:33:56,359 --> 00:33:57,799
Not every Cinderella

659
00:33:58,480 --> 00:33:59,759
falls for a prince.

660
00:34:06,960 --> 00:34:08,119
Don't you want to know

661
00:34:08,519 --> 00:34:09,599
what kind of man I like?

662
00:34:09,639 --> 00:34:10,119
Nope.

663
00:34:11,360 --> 00:34:12,239
I like heroes.

664
00:34:42,920 --> 00:34:43,719
Before you,

665
00:34:44,559 --> 00:34:46,199
we detained another woman,

666
00:34:46,440 --> 00:34:47,320
named Gao Min.

667
00:34:48,400 --> 00:34:49,480
According to her statement,

668
00:34:50,280 --> 00:34:51,519
Qian Feng is her boyfriend,

669
00:34:52,360 --> 00:34:53,719
and they've been dating for over six months.

670
00:34:54,000 --> 00:34:55,440
I believe in the coming days,

671
00:34:55,559 --> 00:34:57,000
we'll very likely uncover

672
00:34:57,000 --> 00:34:58,880
a third woman involved with Qian Feng,

673
00:34:59,480 --> 00:35:00,360
a fourth woman,

674
00:35:00,960 --> 00:35:02,280
or even a fifth.

675
00:35:02,440 --> 00:35:03,559
That's impossible.

676
00:35:03,800 --> 00:35:04,960
You're lying to me.

677
00:35:07,639 --> 00:35:08,280
We have a situation.

678
00:35:09,880 --> 00:35:10,880
You're lying to me!

679
00:35:12,360 --> 00:35:13,800
He told me I was the only one he loved!

680
00:35:14,599 --> 00:35:15,559
You're lying to me, aren't you?

681
00:35:17,119 --> 00:35:17,800
You're lying to me!

682
00:35:18,079 --> 00:35:19,480
You're lying to me!

683
00:35:19,639 --> 00:35:20,800
So we now suspect

684
00:35:20,800 --> 00:35:22,039
the three of you are in this together.

685
00:35:22,199 --> 00:35:23,519
Qian Feng handles communications,

686
00:35:23,679 --> 00:35:25,000
Gao Min moves the drugs,

687
00:35:25,000 --> 00:35:27,000
and you manage the drug money.

688
00:35:27,000 --> 00:35:29,440
You're a drug trafficking gang, aren't you?

689
00:35:29,440 --> 00:35:30,239
No!

690
00:35:30,639 --> 00:35:32,360
I never took any drug money!

691
00:35:32,480 --> 00:35:34,000
I don't know anything!

692
00:35:34,440 --> 00:35:36,159
He said the money was for me to spend!

693
00:35:37,639 --> 00:35:38,440
I didn't know!

694
00:35:38,800 --> 00:35:40,360
I don't know anything about drug money!

695
00:35:40,440 --> 00:35:42,079
I don't know! I don't know anything!

696
00:35:42,079 --> 00:35:43,119
I didn't know!

697
00:35:43,119 --> 00:35:43,320
Don't move!

698
00:35:43,440 --> 00:35:44,719
What are you doing? Let go of me!

699
00:35:45,039 --> 00:35:45,920
Let go of me!

700
00:35:46,079 --> 00:35:46,719
Hold still!

701
00:35:47,039 --> 00:35:48,599
Let go of me! You're all liars!

702
00:35:48,920 --> 00:35:50,000
You liars! Take her away.

703
00:35:50,400 --> 00:35:52,519
You liars! Let go of me!

704
00:35:52,840 --> 00:35:54,400
You bunch of liars!

705
00:35:55,280 --> 00:35:55,800
Are you okay?

706
00:35:56,280 --> 00:35:56,880
I'm fine.

707
00:35:57,239 --> 00:35:58,239
Captain Bai, are you all right?

708
00:35:59,760 --> 00:36:00,920
Go get that checked in the infirmary.

709
00:36:01,199 --> 00:36:02,159
No need, it's nothing.

710
00:36:02,320 --> 00:36:03,440
You're bleeding, and you say it's nothing?

711
00:36:04,039 --> 00:36:05,239
Among drug users,

712
00:36:05,400 --> 00:36:06,360
there can be infectious diseases.

713
00:36:06,519 --> 00:36:08,400
Even though Li Xia claimed no history of drug use,

714
00:36:08,559 --> 00:36:09,880
her urine test results aren't back yet.

715
00:36:10,639 --> 00:36:11,679
Take him to the infirmary,

716
00:36:11,840 --> 00:36:12,400
just to be safe.

717
00:36:19,360 --> 00:36:20,199
It looks like this Li Xia

718
00:36:20,199 --> 00:36:21,199
truly doesn't know anything.

719
00:36:31,880 --> 00:36:32,559
See that?

720
00:36:34,119 --> 00:36:36,000
Half the internet cafes like this in Nanhai

721
00:36:36,320 --> 00:36:37,360
have Brother Biao as a shareholder.

722
00:36:37,360 --> 00:36:38,000
Is that so?

723
00:36:39,039 --> 00:36:40,800
It might not look like much,

724
00:36:41,400 --> 00:36:43,039
but between the monthly rent,

725
00:36:43,280 --> 00:36:44,400
labor, and utilities,

726
00:36:44,559 --> 00:36:46,159
the overhead really adds up.

727
00:36:46,679 --> 00:36:47,800
Doesn't look very crowded to me.

728
00:36:48,159 --> 00:36:49,599
Can't even fill the seats like this.

729
00:36:49,639 --> 00:36:50,440
It's not making money, is it?

730
00:36:52,159 --> 00:36:53,360
Make money? Hell no.

731
00:36:54,159 --> 00:36:57,000
This place loses a ton of cash every day.

732
00:36:57,840 --> 00:36:58,679
Losing money?

733
00:36:59,760 --> 00:37:00,320
Ah Kai,

734
00:37:01,519 --> 00:37:02,960
then why run a business at a loss?

735
00:37:05,559 --> 00:37:08,280
Who makes money above board these days?

736
00:37:11,320 --> 00:37:12,800
See those kids over there?

737
00:37:13,960 --> 00:37:16,159
They show up here every day, like clockwork.

738
00:37:17,079 --> 00:37:18,960
Because I've got what they're looking for.

739
00:37:20,880 --> 00:37:22,480
Those guys used to be club ravers.

740
00:37:22,480 --> 00:37:24,800
Now they're diehard fans of Psychedelic Blues.

741
00:37:26,360 --> 00:37:28,239
Every joint around here sells my stuff now.

742
00:37:28,559 --> 00:37:30,000
So no matter what they use,

743
00:37:30,679 --> 00:37:32,320
and no matter who they buy from,

744
00:37:32,559 --> 00:37:34,159
I'm the one making the money in the end.

745
00:37:35,239 --> 00:37:35,920
Looks like

746
00:37:36,800 --> 00:37:38,719
most of the spots in Nanhai belong to Brother Biao.

747
00:37:39,199 --> 00:37:39,840
I picked the right man to follow.

748
00:37:41,280 --> 00:37:42,360
I wouldn't go that far.

749
00:37:42,559 --> 00:37:43,639
My appetite isn't that big.

750
00:37:44,480 --> 00:37:45,559
Still, in our line of work,

751
00:37:45,559 --> 00:37:47,400
the most important thing is knowing the rules.

752
00:37:47,800 --> 00:37:48,840
Everyone has their own turf.

753
00:37:48,960 --> 00:37:50,119
I always tell them

754
00:37:51,199 --> 00:37:53,039
to stay in their lane and mind their own business.

755
00:38:00,360 --> 00:38:01,559
They're picking up quite a stash.

756
00:38:03,960 --> 00:38:06,119
They don't just use, they have to sell.

757
00:38:06,360 --> 00:38:07,800
It's called dealing to feed the habit.

758
00:38:14,480 --> 00:38:16,440
Truth is, anyone hooked on this stuff

759
00:38:16,800 --> 00:38:18,199
eventually ends up peddling it.

760
00:38:19,159 --> 00:38:20,679
Just like a pyramid scheme, you get it?

761
00:38:21,360 --> 00:38:22,079
Now this is what I call

762
00:38:22,079 --> 00:38:23,920
a truly sustainable business model.

763
00:38:25,280 --> 00:38:25,800
I get it.

764
00:38:28,960 --> 00:38:29,599
You get it?

765
00:38:29,960 --> 00:38:30,800
You've done this before?

766
00:38:32,159 --> 00:38:33,280
Just small-time stuff back then.

767
00:38:33,559 --> 00:38:35,079
Ran errands and pushed product for others.

768
00:38:37,320 --> 00:38:38,760
Small-time won't cut it.

769
00:38:38,760 --> 00:38:39,599
In our line of work,

770
00:38:39,599 --> 00:38:40,920
the most important thing is being ruthless.

771
00:38:41,639 --> 00:38:44,360
You have to bleed every client dry.

772
00:39:02,079 --> 00:39:03,840
By the way, how's your sister?

773
00:39:04,880 --> 00:39:05,840
From what my family told me,

774
00:39:05,840 --> 00:39:06,840
she's doing a lot better now.

775
00:39:10,119 --> 00:39:10,559
Brother Biao,

776
00:39:13,000 --> 00:39:14,800
I'll show you something even wilder later.

777
00:39:34,239 --> 00:39:35,800
Well? Look familiar?

778
00:39:38,639 --> 00:39:39,719
These people are all Nanhai's

779
00:39:39,719 --> 00:39:41,039
most prominent figures.

780
00:39:42,519 --> 00:39:43,559
These big shots do drugs too?

781
00:39:44,719 --> 00:39:45,360
Of course.

782
00:39:47,039 --> 00:39:48,880
They might look respectable,

783
00:39:49,119 --> 00:39:50,199
but once the cravings hit,

784
00:39:50,840 --> 00:39:51,760
they're worse than dogs.

785
00:39:53,239 --> 00:39:54,199
Let's not put it like that.

786
00:39:54,440 --> 00:39:56,639
After all, they're my VIP clients, right?

787
00:39:57,239 --> 00:39:58,639
They only do the high-end stuff.

788
00:39:59,920 --> 00:40:01,320
Heroin No. 4.

789
00:40:04,039 --> 00:40:04,840
Come on, play a few hands.

790
00:40:07,360 --> 00:40:07,719
Sit down.

791
00:40:12,119 --> 00:40:14,000
Get him 100,000 in chips. Put it on my tab.

792
00:40:14,400 --> 00:40:16,519
Brother Biao, I'm afraid my luck's bad.

793
00:40:16,519 --> 00:40:17,440
100,000 is way too much.

794
00:40:17,519 --> 00:40:18,480
If you lose, it's on me.

795
00:40:19,000 --> 00:40:20,400
If you win, just give me back the stake.

796
00:40:22,599 --> 00:40:23,440
Thanks, Brother Biao.

797
00:40:43,559 --> 00:40:44,519
That's good enough.

798
00:40:45,079 --> 00:40:46,760
What do you mean, "good enough"?

799
00:40:47,079 --> 00:40:48,480
If it's not wrapped right, you could get tetanus.

800
00:40:49,039 --> 00:40:50,400
Otherwise, you'll still need a shot after this.

801
00:40:50,719 --> 00:40:52,880
Forget tetanus, you need a rabies shot too.

802
00:40:52,960 --> 00:40:54,239
It's not that serious.

803
00:40:54,559 --> 00:40:55,559
If I say you need one, you get one.

804
00:40:55,800 --> 00:40:57,079
It's only because there's no syphilis vaccine...

805
00:40:57,079 --> 00:40:58,079
...or AIDS vaccine.

806
00:40:58,280 --> 00:40:59,760
Otherwise, you'd be getting every shot out there.

807
00:41:03,079 --> 00:41:04,000
It's just a tiny bite.

808
00:41:04,000 --> 00:41:04,599
Here, let me do it.

809
00:41:04,599 --> 00:41:05,159
Isn't that overkill?

810
00:41:05,159 --> 00:41:06,360
I'm almost done wrapping it.

811
00:41:06,559 --> 00:41:07,599
It's fine, let me check.

812
00:41:09,480 --> 00:41:10,400
Thanks for the trouble, then.

813
00:41:11,000 --> 00:41:11,639
I'm heading out.

814
00:41:30,800 --> 00:41:31,559
You're hurt so badly.

815
00:41:32,159 --> 00:41:32,880
What are you laughing at?

816
00:41:43,079 --> 00:41:44,360
What's wrong? Does it hurt?

817
00:41:44,880 --> 00:41:45,679
Easy, be gentle.

818
00:41:49,320 --> 00:41:50,519
What kind of wrap is this?

819
00:41:53,280 --> 00:41:54,119
I think it looks pretty good.

820
00:41:56,079 --> 00:41:56,840
How is Zhuang Yan's hand?

821
00:41:57,760 --> 00:41:58,280
Captain Bai.

822
00:41:59,800 --> 00:42:00,800
I suspect

823
00:42:01,679 --> 00:42:03,480
that suspect is Qian Feng's accomplice

824
00:42:03,639 --> 00:42:04,400
and has been tailing him.

825
00:42:04,719 --> 00:42:05,840
Besides, back at the bank,

826
00:42:06,119 --> 00:42:07,079
the suspect was likely at the scene.

827
00:42:09,519 --> 00:42:10,079
In that case,

828
00:42:10,280 --> 00:42:11,719
both of you head back to the bank later

829
00:42:11,719 --> 00:42:12,559
and check the surveillance footage

830
00:42:12,840 --> 00:42:14,280
to see if there is any footage of the suspect.

831
00:42:15,000 --> 00:42:15,840
Yes, Captain. Got it.

832
00:42:16,280 --> 00:42:17,719
Why is your hand wrapped like this?

833
00:42:18,840 --> 00:42:19,400
Nurse!

834
00:42:19,480 --> 00:42:20,079
I—

835
00:42:22,880 --> 00:42:23,880
No need, Captain.

836
00:42:31,480 --> 00:42:32,320
How'd it go, Ah Kai?

837
00:42:32,639 --> 00:42:33,800
My luck was terrible today.

838
00:42:34,000 --> 00:42:34,639
I lost everything.

839
00:42:35,800 --> 00:42:36,559
I'm sorry, Brother Biao.

840
00:42:38,400 --> 00:42:39,679
It's fine. It's just chump change.

841
00:42:39,679 --> 00:42:40,760
Come on, let's stop playing.

842
00:42:41,199 --> 00:42:41,480
Come on.

843
00:42:44,880 --> 00:42:47,000
At a casino, you win some, you lose some.

844
00:42:47,400 --> 00:42:48,079
If you lose today,

845
00:42:48,079 --> 00:42:49,480
just win it back tomorrow.

846
00:42:50,480 --> 00:42:52,039
Don't let a little money like this

847
00:42:52,039 --> 00:42:53,239
make me look down on you.

848
00:42:53,800 --> 00:42:55,440
Besides, this isn't thrilling enough.

849
00:42:57,280 --> 00:42:59,360
Later, I'll show you something even wilder.

850
00:43:00,039 --> 00:43:00,480
Brother Biao.

851
00:43:02,000 --> 00:43:02,519
Did they talk?

852
00:43:03,280 --> 00:43:03,840
They talked.

853
00:43:04,599 --> 00:43:06,719
Rat Qiang's men put them up to it.

854
00:43:08,400 --> 00:43:09,480
They've got quite some nerve.

855
00:43:21,280 --> 00:43:22,559
Brother Biao, Brother Biao.

856
00:43:23,480 --> 00:43:25,719
Brother Biao, it's this kid.

857
00:43:25,880 --> 00:43:27,280
He brought his crew and robbed our stash.

858
00:43:31,800 --> 00:43:33,360
Didn't your parents ever teach you

859
00:43:33,360 --> 00:43:35,000
that stealing from others is wrong?

860
00:43:38,519 --> 00:43:38,840
Fine.

861
00:43:41,599 --> 00:43:43,280
Since you like stealing so much,

862
00:43:46,840 --> 00:43:49,000
I'll give you this vial of potassium cyanide.

863
00:43:51,559 --> 00:43:52,920
It might not be a large dose,

864
00:43:53,719 --> 00:43:54,559
but it's more than enough

865
00:43:54,559 --> 00:43:56,280
to send you to the other side.
